    "Approved AMS and AMS 2 Pro V2 geometry preserved.",
    "AMS/AMS 2 Pro spool axes corrected to the printer width direction (X); circular spool faces lie in the YZ plane.",
    "Deeper enclosure and transparent curved lid; front feeder row points in the same direction as printer door.",
    "Rear ports and contact feet revised; no invented front display."
  ],
